<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-043" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-043-appraisal" source-id="s-nanqishu-043-appraisal-ws2400356">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-043-appraisal:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　史臣曰：德成爲上，藝成爲下。觀夫二三子之治身，豈直清體雅業，取隆基構；行禮蹈義，可以勉物風規云。君子之居世，所謂美矣！</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-043-appraisal:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　贊曰：江纂世業，有聞時陂。何申舊主，辭出乎義。謝獻壽觴，載色載刺。思遠退食，沖心篤寄。</p>
</text>
